Pain terminology — IASP (@med-source-pain: 0, is #reference, #part-of @medicine-sources) { r_4V7XHP0R3Y4QQVN47RD1YEVZCV
International Association for the Study of Pain. Terminology, including the revised pain definition and explanatory notes. English.

[Authorized source](https://www.iasp-pain.org/resources/terminology/).

Read pain, nociception, nociceptive pain, neuropathic pain, and nociplastic pain with their notes. Understand the distinction between terminology for experience and terminology for neural processes. The guide summarizes ideas in original wording rather than reproducing the glossary.

**Access and reuse:** Freely readable. IASP provides a permissions process for reprinting or translating its publications. No local reproduction or blanket translation permission is supplied.

